WEBVTT

15:00.217 --> 15:02.470
Sansa is your sister.

15:03.846 --> 15:05.931
I don't hate her.

15:06.682 --> 15:08.017
Not really.

15:09.435 --> 15:13.189
I don't want to frighten you,
but I won't lie to you either.

15:13.314 --> 15:15.691
We've come to a dangerous place.

15:16.734 --> 15:19.195
We cannot fight a war amongst ourselves.

15:20.196 --> 15:22.198
All right?

15:23.240 --> 15:25.493
Go on. It's yours.

15:29.246 --> 15:30.664
I can keep it?
